    "result": {
      "ok": true,
      "stdout": "Draft algorithm capabilities.\r\n\r\nAGENT QUICKSTART (driving this as an agent? start here):\r\n  Browse commands:  lyra-cli <domain> --help\r\n\r\nUSAGE:\r\n  lyra-cli <domain> <[subdomain] ...> <action> [--flags] [--options]\r\n\r\n\r\nOPTIONS:\r\n  -h,     --help              Print this help message and exit\r\n  -v,     --version           Show version information and exit.\r\n          --jq TEXT           Pretty-print JSON output; with an optional selector like\r\n                              .result.items[0].id, output the selected JSON value instead of\r\n                              the full schema envelope.\r\n\r\nSUBCOMMANDS:\r\n  query                       Query a persistent video-tracking task.\r\n  wait                        Wait for a persistent video-tracking task.\r\n  quality-enhance             Enhance video/image quality for target segment(s).\r\n  upscale-resolution          Upscale target segment resolution.\r\n  ai-frame-interpolation      Run AI frame interpolation for a target video segment.\r\n  ai-matting                  Run AI matting on a video or photo segment.\r\n  object-matting-track, mask-tracking-mattingTrack object matting from a seed mask or a target description.\r\n  ai-transition               Generate or write back an AI transition between adjacent videos.\r\n  custom-matting              Run custom matting and validate its mask result when waiting.\r\n  chroma-color-matting        Run chroma color matting on a target segment.\r\n  video-tracking              Run video tracking for a target segment.\r\n  sound-separation            Run vocal/instrument sound separation.\r\n  loudness-normalize          Normalize one audio or video segment to a target loudness.\r\n  denoise                     Apply realtime denoising to one audio or video segment.\r\n  voice-enhance               Enhance human voice on one audio or video segment.\r\n  video-stabilize             Stabilize one video segment and persist its motion matrix.\r\n  tts                         Synthesize speech for a text segment.\r\n  subtitle-recognize          Recognize subtitles or lyrics from the draft or a segment.\r\n  text-add-tone               Add tone/voice metadata to a text segment.\r\n  music-beats                 Detect music beats or melody points.\r\n  material-understand         Understand one draft video segment and persist a reusable sidecar\r\n                              snapshot.\r\n  subtitle-keywords           Detect and apply intelligent subtitle keyword highlights.\r\n\r\nEXAMPLES\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft algo subtitle-recognize --language zh\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft algo ai-matting --seg-id <UUID> --feather 10 --expansion 5\r\n  $ lyra-cli draft algo tts --text \"Hello world\" --seg-id <UUID>\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE\r\n  Use `lyra-cli draft algo <algorithm> --help` for help with a specific algorithm.\r\n",
      "stderr": "",
